<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 - Halaman Tidak Ditemukan</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 flex flex-col min-h-screen text-gray-800">

    <!-- Navbar -->
    <nav class="bg-indigo-600 text-white shadow-md">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <a href="/" class="text-xl font-bold tracking-wide">UserSystem</a>
            <div class="space-x-4">
                <a href="/" class="hover:text-indigo-200 font-medium">Home</a>
                <a href="/users" class="hover:text-indigo-200 font-medium">Users Management</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="flex-grow flex items-center justify-center container mx-auto px-4 py-12">
        <div class="text-center max-w-md">
            <h1 class="text-9xl font-extrabold text-indigo-600">404</h1>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-4">Halaman Tidak Ditemukan</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Maaf, URL <span class="text-red-500 font-mono bg-red-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded"><%= url %></span> tidak dapat ditemukan di server kami.</p>
            <div class="mt-6">
                <a href="/" class="px-6 py-2.5 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-indigo-700 transition inline-block">Kembali ke Beranda</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="bg-gray-800 text-gray-300 py-6 text-center text-sm">
        &copy; 2026 User Management System. All rights reserved.
    </footer>

</body>
</html>